{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a632a5269aea465ff7be1408d0723a2de26a02469649cb85b7b4c3d890d9eaa4", "ja": "青羽さん、どうしました？\nなんだかひどく自分を責めているみたいですが……。", "zh": "青羽小姐，怎么了？\n总觉得你好像在狠狠责怪自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "4d6b5793a64905b73853ab75168fa05a030d80d226f6e878c6e3e52b8bf2ed13", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん、えへへ……。\n実は、今朝見た夢の話なんです。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，嘿嘿……\n其实，是今天早上做的梦啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "1277b61345404d3216a2812d663124fca189be380a2bad2d03e32963df17814f", "ja": "夢で作ってた衣装が、とっても素晴らしくて！\nでも起きたら忘れちゃって。", "zh": "在梦里制作的服装真的超级棒！\n但是醒来之后就忘光了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e0be87ed45283486e2e1efeac9403482d6879be8e5592959aa442c800b23baa4", "ja": "夢の中でも仕事を……お疲れ様です。\n夢か……俺も、あんまり覚えてないですね。", "zh": "做梦都在忙工作……辛苦你了。\n做梦啊……我一般也记不太清呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "65d0744af44b97ded08b634a3c1a730393a4d6cba79f35143c5470022d79ecc3", "ja": "そうですね、すぐ忘れちゃう。\nはぁ、もったいなかったなぁ……。", "zh": "是啊，很快就会忘掉的。\n唉，真是太可惜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "01b2a974fb0dbbba462c7b5397763bf2835a9cb992ae1efe1d28cc8e672bb924", "ja": "覚えてないのに、素晴らしいってわかるなんて、\nなんだかおかしな気もしますけど。", "zh": "明明不记得，却知道那很棒，总觉得有点奇怪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b2bcbbb7cb3deb9413092994d74e19afedc3354dcfa8d42bcde22fa322ed66e7", "ja": "そうですね。でも、きっとまた思い出しますよ。\n一度思いつけたんですから。", "zh": "是啊。不过，一定还会再想起来的。\n毕竟已经想出来过一次了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "525398a4420bd8d6ca61aa9e1b93056a6e8c0d575a993fc8b435beedde0c804f", "ja": "そうですよね！　気にしてても仕方ないし、\n新しい衣装のアイディアでも考えます。", "zh": "是呀！一直放在心上也没用，还是想想新服装的点子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b7d85ec95f9d0c50eeb1abb46b61087271710a7e0786e3c723255cd1ce1cfc21", "ja": "はい、楽しみにしていますね……っと、そうだ！\n今日は事務所に呼ばれてるんでした。行かないと。", "zh": "好的，我很期待哦……等等，对了！\n今天还被叫去事务所了。得过去才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "17eeb945a21072a767f140a478c74811c70f8a9b167c95ca1f8735adaa8de66b", "ja": "あっ、それは忘れたらダメなやつですね……\n留守番してますから、いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "啊，那可不能忘记呢……\n我会留在这里看家的，你去吧——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "9d975c9e523965d3a5a4b926ae7a10f335f8772a977747a38be44a260331a598", "ja": "やあ、よく来てくれたね。\nささ、掛けてくれたまえ。", "zh": "你好，欢迎你来。\n来来，请坐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "c46e2e292c1636d1318c88eeb793ed7ccc9f64477242e3d9009045d86876b36e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nお茶をどうぞ！　あと、ちょっといいケーキも。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n请喝茶！还有稍微高档一点的蛋糕哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4fda4332524688abe9d92467f96f431d0378be22cf6838974e712ac9ed13ffb5", "ja": "えっ？\nどうしたんですか、この高そうなケーキ。", "zh": "诶？\n您这是怎么了，这蛋糕看起来很贵的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "7d6b8f66b56b549cf5620909d271455e13bb514a0509252636734acc0cd9b274", "ja": "うふふ♪　前祝いですよ、前祝い。", "zh": "呵呵♪　这是提前庆祝啦，提前庆祝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "17d0cef9ba9d62d3b65028e9329646f51d7cbabf7688416ac4e0fcdba8da622e", "ja": "前祝い……ということは、今日は何かいい話が？", "zh": "提前庆祝……也就是说，今天是有什么好消息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "75385798ed7226fd3b87142444ffbc6b53f804bb65a85002b6b90f442cf5dd81", "ja": "うおっほん！　今日は君から提案があった、\n学園異能バトルシリーズの、予算案についての話だ。", "zh": "咳咳！今天要谈的是你提议的学园异能战斗系列预算方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "adb9b68a2bd673aa66365021d31f72dd62a8050dc3e4e09660a6b0c1b32cbf6d", "ja": "おおっ！？　それじゃあ……！", "zh": "哦哦！？那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "4b57d39f3ad5ba9d7973501db67e16970a915b1e99ac8b71b05148e11673053d", "ja": "うむ！　ストーリーもいよいよ盛り上がってきて、\nそろそろ大きく勝負を掛けたい、というのも頷ける。", "zh": "嗯！故事终于越来越精彩了，差不多也该放手一搏了，这么想也很有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "638e1b49c0281ff68c8eb8df18f2e125b26a1fd1468c8edb916f6bce6123b00d", "ja": "52人全員出演の、大規模撮影……\n社長として、承認しよう！　存分にやりたまえ。", "zh": "52人全员出演的大规模拍摄……\n作为社长，我批准了！放手去干吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_1020", "source_sha256": "db892e074a4e559674fecfd5a35b8b83f6cdda7edf3bcda293273e284065de8e", "ja": "ガッツポーズ", "zh": "胜利姿势", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "84116da4a89326ca2a5f2d5eb763990726b7741b0c7f2bf07e4687b8dec73e3d", "ja": "やった……！　ありがとうございます！\n期待に応えられるよう、みんなと頑張ります。", "zh": "太好了……！非常感谢！\n为了不辜负您的期望，我会和大家一起努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "a20f9f563910e02ac2088f5b046e988a1b49047cf11b61863ecaf5dc756fd2d2", "ja": "いよいよ、全員の能力が判明したりするんで\nしょうか？　とっても楽しみです！", "zh": "终于要揭晓所有人的能力了吗？\n真是让人好期待呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "0c827c765208df844b547962c9a3f1feaf30ed399632fbba242a4130b4223f49", "ja": "試写会には、絶対に呼んでくれたまえよ！", "zh": "试映会一定要叫上我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "4b2979b2149d9a7b55c89e892e39ca99265c12e326e003fde8be119d75148463", "ja": "あっ、ズルいです！　私もお願いしますね？\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，这太狡猾了！也请算我一个哦？  \n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "0f6d59a7ad5c63a76e1ea13bf5f07187e5716f8323b7f7a00bf59d6843a1df5c", "ja": "（期待してくれているファンも多いシリーズだ。\nいい作品になるよう、フォローしていくぞ！）", "zh": "（这是有许多粉丝期待的系列作品。\n为了让它成为一部优秀的作品，我会好好协助大家的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
